  ('ICI-RUP-SEL-ICI-001', 'Personal accident', 'ICICI Lombard General Insurance Co. Ltd. (ICICI Lombard GIC Ltd.)', '₹2 lakh', 'Ticket booked on card', NULL, 'Nil deductible for air accident cover', 'Primary cardholder', 'Travel insurance is international travel only and the ticket must be purchased using the ICICI Bank Credit Card. Primary cardholder only, supplementary cards are excluded. Card membership termination ends insurance benefits. Complete coverage, exclusions and claim documentation are governed by the ICICI Lombard policy/welcome-kit terms, ICICI Bank may modify, suspend, withdraw or cancel insurance benefits.', 'All claims are settled solely by ICICI Lombard General Insurance Co. Ltd., ICICI Bank is not responsible for claim processing. For claim-related queries contact ICICI Lombard at 1800 2666. Submit the claim and supporting documents as required by the insurer/policy, the insurer determines admissibility and settlement. Claim proceeds may be placed in escrow by the insurer at ICICI Bank’s direction until outstanding card liabilities are discharged.', '30 business days from complete claim document submission'),
